  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就决定选怪颚龙了！\n暴君宝可梦多帅气啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3151B35B9A9009602A989A9F994E86FF01000A66B4541B5B9D53EF68A6591A5E056C14554A300200100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然哥哥你这么说，\n但其实冰雪巨龙也是很强的啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713654E554E54F608FD94E488BF4FF0C000A4F4651765B9E51B096EA5DE89F994E5F662F5F885F3A7684554A300200100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "训练家<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ哥哥姐姐，\n你觉得怪颚龙和冰雪巨龙<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n哪种宝可梦更好呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BAD7EC35BB600100003110000FF020254E554E559D059D0FF0C000A4F6089C95F97602A989A9F99548C51B096EA5DE89F9900100001BE00000A54EA79CD5B9D53EF68A666F4597D5462FF1F00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这件事和不认识的人没关系吧？\n一会儿我们要买的是颚之化石！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94EF64E8B548C4E0D8BA48BC676844EBA6CA151737CFB5427FF1F000A4E004F1A513F62114EEC89814E707684662F989A4E4B531677F3FF0100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "再说了，本来就是要由我来\n决定让哪只宝可梦当伙伴！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n根本不用听琪琪的意见！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "518D8BF44E86FF0C672C67655C31662F8981753162116765000A51B35B9A8BA954EA53EA5B9D53EF68A65F534F194F34FF0100100001BE01000A6839672C4E0D7528542C742A742A7684610F89C1FF0100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真过分！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F8FC75206FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "训练家<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ哥哥姐姐！\n你来让他见识一下冰雪巨龙的实力吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BAD7EC35BB600100003110000FF020254E554E559D059D0FF01000A4F6067658BA94ED689C18BC64E004E0B51B096EA5DE89F9976845B9E529B5427300200100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你只用1只冰雪巨龙\n打赢我哥哥的宝可梦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F6053EA7528003153EA51B096EA5DE89F99000A62538D62621154E554E576845B9D53EF68A6FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我很了解冰雪巨龙！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n把鳍之化石复原成冰雪龙，\n再好好培育它，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n它就会进化成冰雪巨龙！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F884E8689E351B096EA5DE89F99FF0100100001BE01000A628A9CCD4E4B531677F3590D539F621051B096EA9F99FF0C000A518D597D597D57F980B25B83FF0C00100001BE00000A5B835C314F1A8FDB5316621051B096EA5DE89F99FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等你做好了只用1只冰雪巨龙对战的准备，\n就请来和我说一声吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494F60505A597D4E8653EA7528003153EA51B096EA5DE89F995BF96218768451C65907FF0C000A5C318BF76765548C62118BF44E0058F05427FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我很了解冰雪巨龙！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n把鳍之化石复原成冰雪龙，\n再好好培育它，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n它就会进化成冰雪巨龙！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n请只用1只冰雪巨龙来对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F884E8689E351B096EA5DE89F99FF0100100001BE01000A628A9CCD4E4B531677F3590D539F621051B096EA9F99FF0C000A518D597D597D57F980B25B83FF0C00100001BE00000A5B835C314F1A8FDB5316621051B096EA5DE89F99FF0100100001BE01000A8BF753EA7528003153EA51B096EA5DE89F9967655BF962185427FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要和我对战的话，\n就只带1只冰雪巨龙来找我吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那样才合我妹妹的心意。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981548C62115BF9621876848BDDFF0C000A5C3153EA5E26003153EA51B096EA5DE89F996765627E62115427300200100001BE00000A90A36837624D5408621159B959B976845FC3610F300200100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你只带着1只冰雪巨龙来了呀！\n要和我哥哥对战吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6053EA5E267740003153EA51B096EA5DE89F9967654E865440FF01000A8981548C621154E554E55BF962185417FF1F00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要对战！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89815BF96218FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "去做准备",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53BB505A51C659070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了证明它的实力，\n做好准备也是很重要的……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E868BC1660E5B8376845B9E529BFF0C000A505A597D51C659074E5F662F5F8891CD8981768420262026FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了证明它的实力，\n你可不要手下留情呀！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E868BC1660E5B8376845B9E529BFF0C000A4F6053EF4E0D8981624B4E0B755960C55440FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不管这个人是什么样的人，\n也不管冰雪巨龙强不强，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n肯定都是我的宝可梦要更强！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7BA18FD94E2A4EBA662F4EC04E48683776844EBAFF0C000A4E5F4E0D7BA151B096EA5DE89F995F3A4E0D5F3AFF0C00100001BE00000A80AF5B9A90FD662F621176845B9D53EF68A6898166F45F3AFF0100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "厉害厉害！\n冰雪巨龙果然很强！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53895BB353895BB3FF01000A51B096EA5DE89F99679C71365F885F3AFF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这下你懂了吧！\n哥哥！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E0B4F6061C24E865427FF01000A54E554E5FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "强的不是冰雪巨龙，\n是这位训练家<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ哥哥姐姐啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F3A76844E0D662F51B096EA5DE89F99FF0C000A662F8FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB600100003110000FF020254E554E559D059D0554AFF0100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可、可能是这样，但……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF300153EF80FD662F8FD96837FF0C4F462026202600100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以琪琪，今后你就用\n冰雪巨龙来和我对战吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5742A742AFF0C4ECA540E4F605C317528000A51B096EA5DE89F996765548C62115BF962185427300200100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不这样的话，\n就证明不了冰雪巨龙的实力！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FD9683776848BDDFF0C000A5C318BC1660E4E0D4E8651B096EA5DE89F9976845B9E529BFF0100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8BF42026202600100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说我会给你买鳍之化石，\n你可要好好培育它啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8BF462114F1A7ED94F604E709CCD4E4B531677F3FF0C000A4F6053EF8981597D597D57F980B25B83554A300200100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "训练家<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ哥哥姐姐！\n谢谢你和我哥哥对战！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BAD7EC35BB600100003110000FF020254E554E559D059D0FF01000A8C228C224F60548C621154E554E55BF96218FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会培育出\n世界第一的冰雪巨龙的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A57F980B251FA000A4E16754C7B2C4E00768451B096EA5DE89F997684FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请多指教啦！\n我的冰雪龙！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7591A630765595566FF01000A6211768451B096EA9F99FF0100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和琪琪的对战\n是怪颚龙vs冰雪巨龙的对决啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C742A742A76845BF96218000A662F602A989A9F990076007351B096EA5DE89F9976845BF951B3554A300200100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    }
